  "sourceTitle": "Qwen3.8-27B on a 24GB RTX PRO 4000 Blackwell: 128K real context, 785 tok/s prefill, 67 tok/s MTP3 decode",
  "sourceBodyHash": "d985948e0d2e7b363ad6f363aa9bcd55c831ad37511cee80a22fc23f320ff9bc",
