  "translatedBlocks": 25,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "370b93c31e8f7799",
      "translationZh": "我想看看 NInfer 能否在 RTX PRO 4000 Blackwell 24GB 上运行 Qwen3.8-27B。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "061ef862191f7c00",
      "translationZh": "Proxmox 下的 Ubuntu LXC",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "70ed72b333e29e5e",
      "translationZh": "Qwen3.8-27B NInfer 制品",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "07079afcac2e2a18",
      "translationZh": "ruwwww/ninfer-5060ti，分支 rtx-5060ti",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "460bbc8ddd084c81",
      "translationZh": "我使用的是 5060 Ti 分支，而不是 4090 分支，因为 PRO 4000 采用 Blackwell 架构，并且支持 sm_120a。5060 Ti 分支还做了一些修改，会根据 GPU 的实际 SM 数量来计算协同调度，而不是假定使用的是 5090。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b2b9c3b435f412a8",
      "translationZh": "安装缺少的构建依赖项：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ce1ff31e22b1c503",
      "translationZh": "随后，我在 CMake 阶段遇到了下面这个问题：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "54816bee272989e3",
      "translationZh": "这台机器安装了多个 CUDA 工具链。当时选用的是 /usr/bin/nvcc，它未能正确支持 Blackwell 架构专用目标。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6e035194e7aad0a7",
      "translationZh": "真正的 CUDA 13.3 编译器位于这里：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "32e34c2f2328e40b",
      "translationZh": "编译和执行的返回值均为 0，确认了 sm_120a 可以在 RTX PRO 4000 上正常工作。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bb2c12d5b93de10d",
      "translationZh": "然后，我明确指定使用 CUDA 13.3 重新构建了 NInfer：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5803e9be577b37fe",
      "translationZh": "第一次测试采用常规自回归解码，不使用 MTP：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1050b5318611a4d4",
      "translationZh": "配置 预填充 解码 总体",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "76a78e0546c9a6c7",
      "translationZh": "然后，我启用了 Qwen3.8 的 MTP 推测解码：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b248598aa9b1809b",
      "translationZh": "因此，MTP3 将解码速度从约 31 tok/s 提升到了 60 tok/s，在这一工作负载下实现了约 1.9 倍的提升。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "db21c0a1a3521440",
      "translationZh": "然后，我将 KV 缓存切换为 INT8 group-64，并增加了预留上下文容量。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "70f2bfc2a16675fe",
      "translationZh": "预留上下文容量 KV 解码 启动后的空闲显存",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e24a53a99dd3eb0b",
      "translationZh": "MTP3 测试中的草稿 token 接受率始终在 64–68% 左右，每轮推测大约接受 3 个 token，且回退步数为零。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1301d47f24af6df4",
      "translationZh": "有一点重要的说明：这些是上下文容量测试，而不是实际的 32K/64K/128K 提示词基准测试。测试提示词只有约 69 个 token。因此，这证明了 KV 分配能够容纳得下，而且在预留这些容量的情况下，常规短上下文生成仍然稳定；这并不意味着我在对实际包含 128K 个 token 的提示词进行注意力计算时，还能达到约 62 tok/s。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e5813b5cdda305d1",
      "translationZh": "对于这套确切的配置，在 24GB 显存上，128K INT8 似乎已接近实际可用的上限，因为启动后只剩下约 727MB。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a4ab2048bd39cabd",
      "translationZh": "接下来值得尝试的是将较新的 E8 4-bit KV 缓存工作移植到 Blackwell 分支。这有可能让完整的 262K 上下文在 24GB 显存上成为可行的选择。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "eda1eecf3264acd9",
      "translationZh": "不过，目前的结果是：在一张 24GB/145W 的 RTX PRO 4000 Blackwell 上运行 Qwen3.8-27B，启用 MTP3，解码速度约为 62 tok/s，并具备 128K INT8 KV 容量。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "47b2a049e0a0a626",
      "translationZh": "128K NIAH 基准测试：130,048 个提示词 token，INT8 KV，关闭 MTP，关闭思考。预填充耗时 164.7s，速度为 789.6 tok/s；处理完整上下文后的解码速度为 24.4 tok/s。KV 数据占用为 4.12 GiB，剩余显存为 1.73 GiB。模型成功检索出了预先放入的值（ORCHID=493817; COLOR=COBALT），因此这是一次真正的长上下文推理测试，而不仅仅是 KV 分配测试。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "74b265d47270fe86",
      "translationZh": "128K 基准测试：在 RTX PRO 4000 Blackwell 24GB 上运行 Qwen3.8-27B，实际提示词为 130,048 个 token，使用 INT8 KV。预填充：785 tok/s（约 166s）。启用 MTP3 后，128K 上下文后的解码速度达到 67 tok/s，而未启用 MTP 时为 24.4 tok/s（约 2.74× 加速）。在包含 17 个 token 的确定性 NIAH 答案上，MTP 接受率为 100%，模型正确检索出了 ORCHID=493817; COLOR=COBALT。计划使用的显存总量为 21.61 GiB，剩余约 727 MiB。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0afbd29b4e486bbb",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/mmkaywhatevers 提交",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
